{
    "chapter_num": 6,
    "verses_count": 17,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "First Seal: The Conqueror"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now I saw when the Lamb opened one of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M seven seals"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "seals; and I heard one of the four living creatures saying with a voice like thunder, “Come and see.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I looked, and behold, a white horse. He who sat on it had a bow; and a crown was given to him, and he went out conquering and to conquer."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Second Seal: Conflict on Earth"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When He opened the second seal, I heard the second living creature saying, “Come "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit and see"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and see.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Another horse, fiery red, went out. And it was granted to the one who sat on it to take peace from the earth, and that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "people"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " should kill one another; and there was given to him a great sword."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Third Seal: Scarcity on Earth"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When He opened the third seal, I heard the third living creature say, “Come and see.” So I looked, and behold, a black horse, and he who sat on it had a pair of scales"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "balances"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in his hand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I heard a voice in the midst of the four living creatures saying, “A "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gr. choinix, about 1 quart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "quart of wheat for a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "About 1 day’s wage for a worker"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "denarius, and three quarts of barley for a denarius; and do not harm the oil and the wine.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Fourth Seal: Widespread Death on Earth"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When He opened the fourth seal, I heard the voice of the fourth living creature saying, “Come and see.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So I looked, and behold, a pale horse. And the name of him who sat on it was Death, and Hades followed with him. And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "authority"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "power was given to them over a fourth of the earth, to kill with sword, with hunger, with death, and by the beasts of the earth."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Fifth Seal: The Cry of the Martyrs"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When He opened the fifth seal, I saw under the altar the souls of those who had been slain for the word of God and for the testimony which they held. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they cried with a loud voice, saying, “How long, O Lord, holy and true, until You judge and avenge our blood on those who dwell on the earth?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then a white robe was given to each of them; and it was said to them that they should rest a little while longer, until both "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the number of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their fellow servants and their brethren, who would be killed as they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " was completed."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Sixth Seal: Cosmic Disturbances"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I looked when He opened the sixth seal, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit behold"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "behold, there was a great earthquake; and the sun became black as sackcloth of hair, and the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M whole moon"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "moon became like blood. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the stars of heaven fell to the earth, as a fig tree drops its late figs when it is shaken by a mighty wind. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the sky "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or split apart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "receded as a scroll when it is rolled up, and every mountain and island was moved out of its place. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the kings of the earth, the great men, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M the commanders, the rich men,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the rich men, the commanders, the mighty men, every slave and every free man, hid themselves in the caves and in the rocks of the mountains, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and said to the mountains and rocks, “Fall on us and hide us from the face of Him who sits on the throne and from the wrath of the Lamb! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the great day of His wrath has come, and who is able to stand?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}